{"unit_id":"datuloar__dsh-computer-use-win#card-zh","repo":"datuloar/dsh-computer-use-win","commit":"ddddc1500e9af66956170110f81438f7a44fa0f2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cu（DSH 插件，Windows CLI 与 MCP 工具）：让 agent 读取并操作 Windows 桌面。它注册 DSH skill，并通过命令行和 MCP 提供 UI Automation、Windows OCR 与截图能力。用户可查看窗口和控件、按名称点击、输入文字和按键、滚动及读取剪贴板；可选本地视觉模型还能回答屏幕问题。桌面输入显示可由人按 ESC 停止的指示器。适合需要 agent 查看或操作 Windows 应用的场景。需要 Windows、Node.js 18+ 和 PowerShell 5.1；视觉问答需另装模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1-9","src/commands.js:342-370","src/mcp.js:98-160","src/vision.js:39-55"]}
{"unit_id":"datuloar__dsh-computer-use-win#card-en","repo":"datuloar/dsh-computer-use-win","commit":"ddddc1500e9af66956170110f81438f7a44fa0f2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-cu (DSH plugin for Windows) lets agents inspect and control apps via CLI or MCP. Features include UI Automation, OCR, screenshots, named clicks, keyboard input, scrolling, and optional local vision. A visible indicator can be stopped with ESC. Requires Windows, Node.js 18+, and PowerShell 5.1.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1-9","src/commands.js:342-370","src/mcp.js:98-160","src/vision.js:39-55"]}
