{"unit_id":"datuloar__dsh-computer-use-win#feature-1","repo":"datuloar/dsh-computer-use-win","commit":"ddddc1500e9af66956170110f81438f7a44fa0f2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cu 的功能「窗口与控件读取」：列出可见窗口，读取目标窗口的 UI Automation 控件树或按名称查找控件，并可选择窗口标题或进程。通过 windows、tree、find 命令触发，结果包含控件名称和可点击位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/commands.js:342-360","src/mcp.js:107-125"]}
{"unit_id":"datuloar__dsh-computer-use-win#feature-2","repo":"datuloar/dsh-computer-use-win","commit":"ddddc1500e9af66956170110f81438f7a44fa0f2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cu 的功能「桌面输入」：在 Windows 桌面移动或点击指针、拖动、滚动、输入文字和按键组合，也能按控件名称点击。通过 CLI 或 MCP 输入工具触发；输入操作要求屏幕指示器运行。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/commands.js:322-340","src/mcp.js:129-190"]}
{"unit_id":"datuloar__dsh-computer-use-win#feature-3","repo":"datuloar/dsh-computer-use-win","commit":"ddddc1500e9af66956170110f81438f7a44fa0f2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cu 的功能「屏幕文字和截图」：截取全屏或指定区域，并可用 Windows OCR 将画面读成带位置的文字。通过 shot、read 命令或对应 MCP 工具触发，截图可保存为 PNG。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/commands.js:111-160","src/mcp.js:140-155"]}
{"unit_id":"datuloar__dsh-computer-use-win#feature-4","repo":"datuloar/dsh-computer-use-win","commit":"ddddc1500e9af66956170110f81438f7a44fa0f2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cu 的功能「本地视觉问答」：对屏幕或裁剪区域提出问题，由本机运行的视觉模型根据图像返回观察文字及可选位置框。通过 see 命令或 MCP see 工具触发；需先安装本地视觉组件。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/commands.js:124-136","src/vision.js:17-55"]}
{"unit_id":"datuloar__dsh-computer-use-win#caveat-1","repo":"datuloar/dsh-computer-use-win","commit":"ddddc1500e9af66956170110f81438f7a44fa0f2","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cu 使用前须知：仅面向 Windows 桌面，运行需要 Node.js 18+ 和 Windows PowerShell 5.1；UAC 安全桌面和锁屏不可操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/cli.js:32-38","src/commands.js:480-490"]}
